FIBlock-Py
Copyright 2026 Tagir Fabarisov

Python implementation and extension of FIBlock, a model-based fault-injection
framework for cyber-physical systems. The original FIBlock for MATLAB/Simulink
is available at https://github.com/TagirFabarisov/FIBlock.

If you use this software in your research, please cite:

  T. Fabarisov, I. Mamaev, A. Morozov, and K. Janschek,
  "Model-based Fault Injection Experiments for the Safety Analysis of
  Exoskeleton System," Proceedings of the 30th European Safety and
  Reliability Conference and the 15th Probabilistic Safety Assessment and
  Management Conference (ESREL 2020 / PSAM 15), 2020.
  arXiv:2101.01283.

